    "updated_at": "2018-10-19T13:19:47Z",
    "body": "\"must\" would prevent the browser from ever collecting them, which also increases costs, right?  This  is why browsers have the behavior they have now:  They avoid creating new collections if they can avoid it, but still get rid of old ones so their listeners don't keep slowing down DOM operations.",
